<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: 고속 고공 비행 -->
  <Miho_MechAbility_High_Jump.label>高速飞行</Miho_MechAbility_High_Jump.label>
  <!-- EN: 차체 안에 있는 열을 이용해 증기를 발사하여 고속으로 날아갑니다. -->
  <Miho_MechAbility_High_Jump.description>借助机体内因燃烧高温产生的蒸汽能量，快速飞行到远处。</Miho_MechAbility_High_Jump.description>
  <!-- EN: jump -->
  <Miho_MechAbility_High_Jump.verbProperties.label>飞行</Miho_MechAbility_High_Jump.verbProperties.label>
  
  <!-- EN: 마지막 고속 고공 비행 -->
  <Miho_MechAbility_High_JumpExplosion.label>高速飞行（自爆）</Miho_MechAbility_High_JumpExplosion.label>
  <!-- EN: 차체 안에 있는 열을 이용해 증기를 발사하여 고속으로 날아간 후, 본체에 내장된 폭약과 함깨 사라집니다. -->
  <Miho_MechAbility_High_JumpExplosion.description>借助机体内因燃烧高温产生的蒸汽能量，快速飞行到远处，随后引爆身上装载的所有炸药。</Miho_MechAbility_High_JumpExplosion.description>
  <!-- EN: jump -->
  <Miho_MechAbility_High_JumpExplosion.verbProperties.label>飞行</Miho_MechAbility_High_JumpExplosion.verbProperties.label>

